WEBVTT

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.950
"Sunohara House"

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.410
It sure has been hot lately.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Who's that?!

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:10.000
"High School Girl, Swimsuits, Summer Break"

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:13.500
Is this the wrong room?

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:19.450
My bad. Nobody was in there,
so I just went in. No big deal, right?

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:22.700
Like, it was my room up till March, anyway.

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:27.330
It's kind of a riot that you're using it now.

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:28.410
U-Um, excu--

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:30.330
Whoa! Check this out!

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:32.370
Like, this is a 6th grade textbook!

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:34.410
I'm legit nostalgic!

00:02:34.410 --> 00:02:36.200
OMG, I'm weak!

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:40.040
Look at this cover!

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:40.040
She sure has a lot of energy...

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:44.580
Anyway, it gets pretty hot
in here with no A/C unit, huh?

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:45.790
Better strip down.

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:47.660
What's even left?!

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:52.330
Just kidding. The young ones
freak out so hard. I love it.

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:56.540
Oh, I'm Nana, by the way.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:58.790
What's your name?

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:01.660
M-My name is Aki Shiina.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:04.250
Aki? Wait, are you a girl?

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.540
I'm a guy!

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:10.870
You are? Lemme check.

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:17.790
Having an older woman do this
to you--it's not bad, is it?

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.450
Be quieter, Shiina.

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:24.580
Just because it's summer break doesn't mean--

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:26.660
Nana- <i>sempai</i> ?

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:29.250
Oh, it's Yucchi. What's up?

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:31.290
I-I'll just be going now.

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:33.080
P-President!

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:36.080
Gotcha! Gotcha! Gotcha!

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:38.870
Long time, no see, Sempai.

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:40.160
Too long!

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:44.200
Oh, right. I have something
to show you, Yucchi.

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:49.950
Shiina and I will be in the hall.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:54.120
It's really no big deal.

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:58.080
President, you know Nana?

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:00.330
She's the previous President.

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:06.290
What? Aren't Student Council members
selected based on their grades?

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:08.950
She's tough in a lot of ways.

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:10.370
Tough?

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:13.290
And Ayaka's--

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:13.290
You can come in now.

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:14.950
Well, you'll see.

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:18.870
Tada! How do I look?

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:20.790
Y-You look great.

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:22.160
I know, right?

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:25.580
I just love how it has that
classic high school girl look.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.500
Check it out.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.250
Shiina, don't look!

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:35.080
Aww, check me out more.

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.450
Right, Aki?

00:04:36.450 --> 00:04:39.870
I-I, uh... um...

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:42.790
Don't tease Shiina so much.

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:46.450
Oh? Why? Because you have a relationship?

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:47.870
That's not it!

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:53.580
I'm the boss at Sunohara House now.
I won't permit you to do as you please.

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:56.410
You wanna have a go at me?

00:04:56.410 --> 00:05:00.580
I'm not the same girl I was last year.

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:03.790
Please, as if I'd lose to a middle schooler.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.660
They've started something.

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:14.410
Solve the simultaneous equations!
3x + 8y = x + y = 5

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:17.660
x=7 y=-2

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:20.540
Your face obscurrèd like the moon resideth.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:23.000
In tears spilt over spring of old.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.410
Ari, wori, haberi!

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:25.660
Imasokari!

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:27.660
1185 C.E., Kamakura Shogunate!

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.660
1334 C.E., Kenmu Restoration!

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:32.540
Hydrogen, Helium, Lithium, Beryllium!

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:38.200
High school material... She fights dirty!

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:40.620
I guess Nana won.

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:45.750
I won, so as we agreed, Aki's mine!

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:48.410
No one agreed to that!

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.620
This is a separate issue.

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:53.290
Don't be a sore loser.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:56.910
Akkun, Yuzu- <i>chan</i> , no fighting.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:59.750
M-Miss Caretaker! Save me!

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:01.450
Nana- <i>chan</i> !

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:02.950
I'm hoooome.

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:07.500
When did you get here? If you'd told me,
I would have gone to meet you.

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:13.080
Don't sweat it, sis. You're busy,
and it was kinda fun walking around by myself.

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:14.410
It was?

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:16.000
S-Sis?

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:16.000
Yeah.

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:18.580
"Sunohara House"

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:29.790
Sis, I'd forgotten how yummy your food is!
Like, mine isn't this good yet.

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:31.870
Seconds!

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:32.910
Certainly.

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:35.370
Nana-sempai, how long will you be here?

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.790
For a while, since it's summer.

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:41.750
Let's have lots of fun together,
Kazamin. You, too, Sumichi.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.160
Yes, let's.

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:47.410
Please refrain from anything that
would corrupt public morals here.

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:50.700
I would never do such a thing!

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:54.250
Later I'll have fun with you, too, Yucchi.

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:55.540
No, thank you.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:58.830
Since it's summer break,
let's go somewhere like old times.

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:01.660
Maybe the pool? Ooh! Or a festival!

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:04.580
Wait, why not both? Both!

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:04.580
What's wrong, Akkun?

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:09.250
Miss Caretaker, you and Nana
are sisters, but you're so different.

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:11.580
And then there's the thing about fighting...

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:14.250
Are we really so different?

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:20.830
U-Um, Nana is very aggressive
and, um, lively and--

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:26.700
Still, she's incredibly kind and a good person.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:27.700
Here.

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:33.290
Sis, after dinner, let's bathe
together. Like we used to.

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:34.580
Aki, wanna join us?

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:35.540
What?!

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:37.540
Resist her wiles, Shiina!

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:02.370
N-Nana?! H-How?

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:07.330
Morning...

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:11.580
Why is Aki here...?

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:19.830
If you wanted to sleep with me,
all you had to do was ask.

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:22.040
You know this is my room.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:31.290
My bad. My bad.
I went to this room out of habit.

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:32.700
Jeez.

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:40.700
What is it? You're gonna make a girl blush.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:49.290
This is a disaster! He saw me without makeup!

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:58.830
Game on, man!

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:01.910
At least knock.

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:09.790
All right. Sis still hasn't found it.

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:12.200
There's a hiding place up there?

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:15.000
You can use it for your dirty magazines.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.660
I don't have any!

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:23.200
Sis nags me about it. "Only an hour
of beep-boop time a day," she says.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:26.580
I'm surprised. I didn't take you for a gamer.

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:30.620
I guess I just can't help but
give off an aura of intelligence.

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:33.750
I would call it an outdoorsy vibe.

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:36.040
Have you ever played this game?

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.830
It's so fire.

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:41.080
Actually, I've never played
a video game before.

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:42.910
No way! For real?

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:52.040
I guess that means
I'm going to be your first, Aki.

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:54.250
Why did you pause like that?

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:59.080
Let your big sister Nana show you the ropes.

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:00.200
Get over here.

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:04.580
I sit there?!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:05.830
I'm not asking.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:08.200
O-Okay.

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:10.040
Pardon me.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:13.250
So comforting!

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:18.250
Yucchi resisted at first, but you're docile, Aki.

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:20.660
What am I, a cat?

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:21.660
Take this!

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:29.540
There! There! Farther!
Yes! Yes... No! Not like that!

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:35.870
Aww, you messed up in the same spot.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:40.540
If you don't focus, you'll never clear it.

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:43.910
Just whose fault do you
think it is that I can't focus?

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.160
Lemme see this.

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:47.040
Hey... wait... Nana?

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:48.540
Just look at the screen.

00:10:53.910 --> 00:10:56.200
She smells so nice.

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:58.160
Focus on the game!

00:10:58.160 --> 00:10:59.200
O-Okay!

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:03.080
Focus only on the game. Focus only
on the game. Focus only on the game.

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:06.160
Center in on the target and pull the trigger.

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:07.700
Center in on the target and pull the trigger!

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:12.620
Focus only on the game!
Focus only on the game! Fo--!

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:14.660
You did it! I knew you could.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:19.870
Hey!

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.410
Miss Caretaker?

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:31.620
Are you awake?

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:33.290
Nana.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:35.290
They really are sisters.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:40.450
The fighting thing worried me, but she has
the same air about her as Miss Caretaker.

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:41.450
And she's kind...

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:45.580
You're a real riot! You just suddenly fainted.

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:48.410
Now we can play this fighting game!

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:50.540
We're not done yet?

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:57.450
My friends don't like games.
All we do is talk about fashion and boys.

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:03.250
So you're not getting any sleep tonight!

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.750
It's still morning...

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:13.870
Hah! I win again!

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:15.830
I'm the queen of 1 on 1!

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:18.410
Was the stuff about fighting about this?

00:12:18.410 --> 00:12:21.290
I guess you weren't quite ready for this, huh?

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:23.370
You couldn't beat me in a million years!

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:26.700
I'll get you this time.

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:35.040
You couldn't beat me in a million years!

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:40.120
You couldn't beat me in a million years!

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:45.000
You couldn't beat me in a million years!

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:45.000
Yayyyyyyy!

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:50.830
You couldn't beat me in a <i>million years</i> !

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:55.660
Akkun, breakfast is ready.

00:12:55.660 --> 00:13:00.040
Oh, my. I told you, no more than
an hour of beep-boop time a day!

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:02.660
At least knock!

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:04.910
That's my line...

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:08.200
Sis, Sis, I want to keep him at my place!

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:09.870
What?!

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:13.330
You can't. Aki already has a caretaker.

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:14.620
Miss Caretaker!

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:27.580
Aki!

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.790
Help me apply my tanning lotion.

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:36.910
U-Uh...

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:38.250
Akkun!

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.330
Would you help me with my sunscreen?

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:44.580
Miss Caretaker, too?

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:46.080
Please.

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:48.250
Don't resist.

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:49.620
Akkun.

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:50.950
Akiii.

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:00.000
A dream?

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:05.200
Again?!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:20.620
To the water slide!

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:22.200
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:27.120
Today, we all went to the pool
at Nana's suggestion.

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:29.540
Akkun.

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:31.160
Sorry I took so long.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:37.040
Let's do our best with
your swimming practice, okay?

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:38.910
R-Right!

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:41.830
Oh, sunscreen.

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:43.700
I forgot to put some on.

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:45.580
Wait here a moment.

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:06.910
Hey there, mister.

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:09.790
Here alone?

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:13.250
Want to have fun with us?

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:15.580
Or should I say young man.

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:18.950
Wait, what? The city is scary!

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:20.700
I-I-I'm waiting for someone.

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:23.660
Just come with us.

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:25.950
We're much more fun.

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:33.040
Hold it right there.
What are you doing to my Aki?

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:34.160
Nana.

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:36.160
Wait. Mai? Uchifuji?

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.330
Nana?

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:41.870
You tried to hit on Aki? I'm dying.

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:45.000
Um... do you know them?

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:46.330
Mai here!

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:48.040
I'm Uchifuji!

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:51.250
We're friends, and we hang out
with Nana at school.

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:55.120
Our interests include younger men!

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:56.500
Nice to meet you.

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:57.870
Yeah!

00:15:57.870 --> 00:15:59.450
They're really into this.

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:04.040
Hey, isn't this who we saw
the other day in town?

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:07.160
Yes. This is the one. The guy, even.

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:14.870
My radar must be broken. How could
I mistake such a cute guy for a girl?

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:18.200
Say, Nana, is this kid your boyfriend?

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:20.790
Boyfr--

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:20.790
You really have a sharp eye.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:23.750
No, no. It's not like that.

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:29.660
He's more like my pet, or something.
Anyway, he's mine.

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:31.200
Get it, girl!

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:34.540
I don't even know where to start.

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:37.250
Akkun. Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:39.830
Who's this?

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:41.540
My big sister.

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:47.540
Oh, you're friends of Nana?
Thank you for all you do for her.

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:50.750
It's overwhelming.

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:53.120
Sister? More like mother.

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:02.120
Sis, lend me Aki for the day.

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:08.200
I just said he was mine.
I'll look stupid if I just let him go.

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:13.830
Sorry, but we came
to help Aki learn how to swim.

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:15.580
Please, just this once.

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:18.160
Nana. What's going on?

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:20.790
Hold on a sec...

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:29.580
Oh, right. We agreed whoever swims
the fastest gets to have Aki for the day.

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:32.080
What?!

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:32.080
We didn--

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:35.910
Come on, Sis. If you win,
I'll leave you alone all day.

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:40.000
All right, then.

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:44.000
Let the swim battle for Akkun begin.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:47.370
Prepare to go down.

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:50.200
I've just been turned into a prize!

00:17:57.250 --> 00:17:58.620
Are you getting the stuff?

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:00.660
Yes. It's perfect.

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:06.290
Hurry up and get in, you two!
You're missing all the fun!

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:07.830
I'll take my usual order.

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:23.830
Hello. The Swim Battle
for Akkun is about to begin.

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:26.700
Providing commentary are
your host, Maiko Osonoi...

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:30.120
...and me, Mea Uchifuji. Hiya, folks.

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:33.000
Anyway, how lucky can you be, kid?

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:35.790
Play with us some time, too.

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:40.580
Good thing we're at the pool.

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:46.580
I can't beat Sis in other areas, but
with sports, my youth gives me an edge!

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:50.830
In fact, I have the advantage precisely
because I don't measure up to her.

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:55.200
Yep. The bigger your boobs,
the greater the water resistance!

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:57.580
On your marks!

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:09.040
Get set...

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:12.370
No dive, huh. Are you throwing the match, Sis?

00:19:12.370 --> 00:19:13.450
Go!

00:19:17.450 --> 00:19:19.950
We've got backstroke, folks!

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:24.040
Clever. She's using her boobs for buoyancy.

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:27.250
Her weakness is now her strength!

00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:29.870
Is that effective?

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:32.750
You're a have-not, so maybe you can't tell.

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:35.950
Hey!

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:39.000
You like bigger boobs better, don't you, kid?

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:42.830
That's completely off topic!

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:48.580
She surprised me,
but there's still a gap between us.

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:53.910
Goal!

00:19:56.370 --> 00:19:58.000
Who won?

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.750
They're not even looking!

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:03.500
Size isn't all that matters, is it, my boy?

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:06.910
Boob might makes boob right, Mai.

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:11.700
I totally won, right?

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:13.910
Huh? I couldn't tell.

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:17.870
Sis, another race!

00:20:17.870 --> 00:20:19.250
Oh, my.

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.620
Another race!

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.450
Another race!

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:41.540
Another race!

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:38.450
Do you like...

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:41.540
Pet, pet, pet...

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:41.540
Here, have some...

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:45.660
Another... race!

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:52.410
I'm bored now.

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:53.830
See ya.

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:09.000
Ano... ther... race.

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:10.660
Hey.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:12.160
Time to go, Shiina.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.500
President.

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:15.620
What are they doing?

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:17.370
<i>Another race</i> !

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:23.580
I can't anymore.

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:26.040
Then I win by default.

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:36.200
What's with her stamina?

00:21:37.910 --> 00:21:42.620
Sorry for the wait.
Now then, let's begin your lesson.

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:44.370
Miss Caretaker...

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:49.660
It's closing time now.

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:50.790
Oh, my.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:54.580
This one will be quadruple digits.

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:55.750
Priceless.

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:42.000
"Ghosts, Homework, Massage"
